  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_fagottus_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>roll as a packing unit of pieces of cloth or clothing (Latham, Word-List, s.v. fagottus), here as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size | roll as a packing unit of pieces of cloth or clothing (Latham, Word-List, s.v. fagottus) | roll (of pieces of cloth) | a roll (usually of pieces of cloth), here as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
